# SHA-256 hashes of banned private names, one lowercase hex digest per line.
# The names themselves stay out of this public repository.
# These hashes are not secret: an unsalted SHA-256 of a short name can be
# reversed with a word list. Use the CYBERAU_PRIVATE_NAMES repository secret
# for any name that must not be guessable.
# Add a name without echoing it:
#   uv run --project mcp python tools/ci/style_check.py --add-name
# The tool lowercases the name and joins its words with single spaces.
# While this list is empty the check warns on every run that it is inactive.
